            "reviewBody": "Fun to make-n-shake and sweet on the tongue! If you love sweet drinks this is perfect for you. If you enjoy a more flavorful martinis add the juice of one whole lime and use “just cranberry” juice without sweetener. Also, I used a slice of green apple for a bit of sour flavor and color rather than a maraschino cherry.",
